Package: attitudedyn
Title: The Nepaul-Stern Model of Attitude Stability and Constraint
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Gabriel", "Mihalache", email = "mihalache.2@osu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Gabriel Mihalache [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Gabriel Mihalache <mihalache.2@osu.edu>
Description: Estimates The Nepaul-Stern Model of Attitude Stability and
    Constraint (Nepaul and Stern, 2026) <doi:10.1017/pan.2026.10034> for
    several Likert-scale attitudes measured on the same people across
    survey waves. The likelihood is a Geweke-Hajivassiliou-Keane simulated
    likelihood. The latent attitude carries forward from one wave to the
    next.
